led with competing factions and meaningful choices that shape your adventure.  Journey from dense forests to the scorching Burning Springs and the radioactive Cranberry Bog, where every region is filled with unique stories, hidden rewards, and legendary cryptids. Hunt or be hunted by the mysterious Mothman, towering Sheepsquatch, or the legendary Bigfoot that stalks the wilderness.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/9f1afaf5bf7bf8f9f9e08984ecfed339.avif?t=1791379859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras_big/9f1afaf5bf7bf8f9f9e08984ecfed339.webp?t=1791379859 width=1560 height=292 /></span>The Slasher </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritual murder sprees grip Appalachia’s denizens in terror! Join the investigation to find who - or what - is responsible as you (grave)dig up clues, stop cultist Infestations across the Wasteland and go on a brand-new Head Hunt event to uncover the truth behind the return of the notorious Slasher!</p>",
